# Downloaded/copied source database files, ~14 MB. Regenerate with 01_download.py.
# Most of them already exist elsewhere in this repo (exp_db/, LLPS_DB_data/), so
# tracking them here would be a second copy. Same policy as the repo's exclusion of
# Predictors_whole_genome_sets/ and data/alphafold_pdbs/.
raw/

# Run logs and bytecode.
run.log
__pycache__/

# master.csv IS tracked, deliberately.
#
# The repo root .gitignore has a `build/` rule -- that is the Python packaging
# convention (dist/, eggs/, wheels/), and it catches minimal/build/ by accident. Our
# build/ is not a packaging directory, it holds the one table every later step reads.
# It is 316 KB, and having it in the repo means someone can clone, open 04_stats.py
# and run it without first rebuilding. These two lines undo the root rule for it.
!build/
!build/master.csv
